    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_0251",
      "reading_order": 294,
      "severity": "caution",
      "content": "CAUTION: Some parts are sensitive to electrostatic discharge (ESD). Always perform service",
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.0,
        "t": 657.405,
        "r": 172.75,
        "b": 645.815
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0037",
      "reading_order": 296,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 181.80407826272662,
        "t": 661.3699340820312,
        "r": 202.14023852768912,
        "b": 640.3336029052734
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0037.png",
      "decorative": true,
      "width": 20,
      "height": 21,
      "image_hash": "db50a16dc14b8c6fb87164ac03515bd6d3e3e7f95b3c713328015cecca1de3fc",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0253"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0253",
      "reading_order": 297,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.0,
        "t": 638.79,
        "r": 540.7700400000001,
        "b": 603.2
      },
      "content": "work at an ESD-protected workstation or mat. If an ESD workstation or mat is not available, touch the sheet-metal chassis to provide a static ground before touching an ESD-sensitive assembly. Protect the ESD-sensitive assemblies by placing them in ESD pouches when they are out of the printer."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0254",
      "reading_order": 298,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.00004,
        "t": 593.79,
        "r": 539.6300400000002,
        "b": 558.2
      },
      "content": "If the replacement part is a roller or pad, avoid touching the spongy part of it. Skin oils on the roller or pad can cause paper pickup and/or print-quality problems. HP recommends using disposable gloves when handling rollers or pads or washing your hands before touching rollers or pads."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0255",
      "reading_order": 299,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.0,
        "t": 548.79,
        "r": 532.73,
        "b": 525.2
      },
      "content": "IMPORTANT: Make sure that all of the shipping materials (for example shipping tape) are removed from the replacement part prior to installation."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0256",
      "reading_order": 300,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.0,
        "t": 514.29,
        "r": 334.02,
        "b": 502.70000000000005
      },
      "content": "To install an assembly, reverse the removal steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0257",
      "reading_order": 301,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.00002,
        "t": 493.28999999999996,
        "r": 542.6100400000003,
        "b": 457.7
      },
      "content": "When applicable, special installation instructions are provided for an assembly at the end of the removal procedure. Always completely read the removal instructions and follow all special installation instructions."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0258",
      "reading_order": 302,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.00004,
        "t": 448.29,
        "r": 219.39003999999997,
        "b": 436.7
      },
      "content": "Install the staple cartridge."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0259",
      "reading_order": 303,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.00005,
        "t": 427.29,
        "r": 193.01005,
        "b": 415.7
      },
      "content": "Stapler models only"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0260",
      "reading_order": 304,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.00005,
        "t": 406.29,
        "r": 375.9100500000001,
        "b": 394.7
      },
      "content": "Push the staple cartridge straight into the printer to install it."
    },
